  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanding Community Approaches in Conflict Situations in Three Southernmost Provinces in Thailand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to contribute to confidence-building between communities and sub-district authorities insouthern Thailand through participatory local development approaches in six sub-districts, and through capacity building ofselected local government officials as well as selected civil society networks and organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
